<title>USA: Oak Lawn Park Dist, Ill., yields 5.35 pct in 2011.</title>
<headline>Oak Lawn Park Dist, Ill., yields 5.35 pct in 2011.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Chicago Capital Markets said it tentatively priced $5.180 million of Oak Lawn Park District, Ill., general obligation alternate revenue refunding bonds, series 1997, with a top yield of 5.35 percent in 2011.</p>
</text>
